## bpx-council — AI advisor

This project uses [bpx-council](https://github.com/gabelul/bpx-council), a CLI that gets a second opinion or multi-model council before committing to a direction.

When to use it:
- Before architecture decisions
- When stuck on a bug
- Before declaring a task done

```bash
bpx-council "Should I use REST or GraphQL?"
bpx-council --mode council "Monolith or microservices?"
```

Install: `npm install -g @booplex/bpx-council`
